{"seq":1,"slug":"product-and-branding","title":"产品与品牌","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/marketing/marketing-mix-4p/product-and-branding","wordCount":1476,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"产品与品牌\">产品与品牌</h1><p>人们买的真的是&quot;产品&quot;吗？买电钻的人其实想要的是&quot;墙上那个洞&quot;，买口红的人想要的可能是&quot;出门时的那份底气&quot;。这一节我们就从这个反直觉的视角切入，看看产品到底是什么、它会经历怎样的生命周期，以及品牌如何为同一件物品注入截然不同的价值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><ul>\n<li>产品不是单一的物，而是分层次的：核心利益、有形产品、附加服务三层叠加。</li>\n<li>顾客买的是&quot;利益&quot;而非&quot;功能&quot;，看懂这一点能帮你跳出&quot;参数内卷&quot;的陷阱。</li>\n<li>产品生命周期通常分四个阶段：导入、成长、成熟、衰退，每个阶段的营销重点完全不同。</li>\n<li>品牌是产品之外的一层无形资产，它降低顾客的选择成本，也支撑产品的溢价能力。</li>\n<li>品牌资产（brand equity）让同样的产品因为不同的牌子，卖出截然不同的价格和忠诚度。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><p>先理解<strong>产品的三个层次</strong>。最里面是<strong>核心利益</strong>——顾客真正想解决的问题（想要墙上的洞）；中间是<strong>有形产品</strong>——把利益实体化的东西（电钻的功率、外观、品牌名）；最外面是<strong>附加产品</strong>——围绕实体的服务（保修、退换、安装指导）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[核心利益: 顾客要解决的根本问题] --&gt; B[有形产品: 功能/外观/质量/品牌名]&#10;    B --&gt; C[附加产品: 保修/配送/售后/安装]\">graph TD\n    A[核心利益: 顾客要解决的根本问题] --&gt; B[有形产品: 功能/外观/质量/品牌名]\n    B --&gt; C[附加产品: 保修/配送/售后/安装]</pre><p>这三层的实战价值在于：当品类竞争白热化、有形产品越来越同质时，胜负往往在最外层的附加产品上决出。两台参数相近的家电，谁的安装更省心、售后更靠谱，谁就赢了——因为顾客买的是&quot;省心地解决问题&quot;这个完整利益，而不只是冷冰冰的参数。</p>\n<p><strong>产品生命周期</strong>是另一个必须建立的直觉。任何产品都不会永远好卖，它通常会走完一条钟形曲线：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>销量特征</th>\n<th>营销重点</th>\n<th>利润状况</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>导入期</td>\n<td>缓慢起步</td>\n<td>建立认知、教育市场</td>\n<td>多为亏损</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成长期</td>\n<td>快速攀升</td>\n<td>扩大份额、建立偏好</td>\n<td>开始盈利</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成熟期</td>\n<td>增速放缓见顶</td>\n<td>守份额、找差异、促复购</td>\n<td>利润最高但竞争最激烈</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>衰退期</td>\n<td>持续下滑</td>\n<td>收割、转型或退出</td>\n<td>利润萎缩</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>新手最容易犯的错，是用&quot;成长期的打法&quot;去应对&quot;成熟期的市场&quot;——比如在一个早已饱和的红海里还指望靠铺量获客，结果获客成本高得离谱。看懂产品处在哪个阶段，才能配上对的策略。</p>\n<p><strong>品牌为什么能创造价值？</strong> 把产品和品牌剥开看：产品满足的是功能性需求，品牌满足的是身份、信任和情感需求。一瓶成分相近的饮料，贴上知名品牌后能卖更贵，原因有三：品牌降低了顾客的<strong>选择成本</strong>（不用每次都从头研究），提供了<strong>质量背书</strong>（出了名的牌子不敢乱来），还承载了<strong>情感与身份</strong>（用某个品牌是在表达&quot;我是什么样的人&quot;）。</p>\n<p>这就引出<strong>品牌资产</strong>的概念——品牌本身作为一项资产，能带来超额价值。它的来源通常包括：知名度（顾客想得起你）、感知质量（顾客信得过你）、品牌联想（提到你顾客脑子里浮现的画面）、品牌忠诚（顾客愿意一再选你)。值得注意的是，2026 年一个被反复验证的教训是：<strong>长期靠打折促销会侵蚀品牌资产</strong>——折扣能换来短期销量，却会让顾客把你和&quot;便宜&quot;绑定，一旦恢复原价就卖不动。所以越来越多品牌转向用价值和体验来维护溢价，而不是靠价格战续命。</p>\n<p>我们甚至可以把品牌对价格的支撑粗略表达成：品牌资产越强，顾客愿意接受的溢价空间越大。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{premium} = P_{branded} - P_{generic}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">mi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">an</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{branded}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">an</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是有品牌时顾客愿付的价，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{generic}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是无品牌同类产品的价，两者之差 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{premium}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">mi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 正是品牌资产变现的部分。一个强品牌，本质就是把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{premium}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">mi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 做大并守住。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>选一件你最近买的产品，用三个层次拆一拆：它的核心利益、有形产品、附加产品分别是什么？促使你购买的关键在哪一层？</li>\n<li>判断你熟悉的一个产品当前处于生命周期的哪个阶段，并说说它现在的营销动作和这个阶段是否匹配。</li>\n<li>思考题：一个品牌为了冲销量连续半年大力度打折，按本节关于品牌资产和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{premium}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">mi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的逻辑，它可能在透支什么？停止打折后会面临什么风险？</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>莱维特&quot;营销近视症&quot;的经典论述，提醒企业别盯着产品本身、要盯着顾客的利益，是理解&quot;核心利益&quot;的最佳补充。</li>\n<li>凯勒《战略品牌管理》对品牌资产模型有系统讲解，适合想深入品牌的人。</li>\n<li>观察一个你认为&quot;贵得有道理&quot;的品牌，试着拆出它的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{premium}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">mi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 主要来自知名度、感知质量、联想还是忠诚。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>这一节我们把 4P 的根——产品讲透了：产品分三层，顾客买的是利益不是功能；产品有生命周期，不同阶段要用不同打法；品牌是产品之外的无形资产，能创造并守住溢价，而长期打折会侵蚀它。把产品和品牌的关系想明白，下一节我们就能进入 4P 里最直接影响收入、也最考验功力的一环——定价。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"产品与品牌","id":"产品与品牌"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"定位战略","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/marketing/market-research-stp/positioning-strategy"},"next":{"title":"定价策略","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/marketing/marketing-mix-4p/pricing-strategies"}}